  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TAFISA-Womens Leadership in Sport for All Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TAFISA will collaborate with local partner TIBU Africa to address gender equity in sports across Morocco and Northern Africa. Through workshops, mentorship, and networking, the project aims to empower women leaders, enhance gender equality in sports governance, and promote social inclusion. The initiative aligns with UN Sustainable Development Goals, focusing on training women in Sport for All leadership, fostering regional networks, and advocating for gender equity policies. By empowering local women, the project seeks to catalyse broader social change, promoting women&amp;#39;s participation and leadership in sports across the region, with measurable impact and sustainable outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
